{
  "format": "zylab.notebook.v1",
  "metadata": {
    "title": "科学计算：数值方法",
    "description": "傅里叶级数逼近、常微分方程数值解（欧拉/RK4）、牛顿法求根与梯形法则积分，含公式与收敛曲线。",
    "created": "2026-09-10T14:56:50",
    "modified": "2026-09-10T15:10:00"
  },
  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "0ddd0dff0ea34a0ba592f17559c5cf2a",
      "source": "# 傅里叶级数：方波的正弦级数逼近\n# f(x) = (4/π)·Σ_{k=1,3,5,…} sin(kx)/k\n# 谐波项越多越接近方波；间断点附近存在吉布斯过冲（约 9%）\ndef square_wave(x, n_terms):\n    s = np.zeros_like(x)\n    for k in range(1, 2 * n_terms, 2):\n        s += sin(k * x) / k\n    return (4 / pi) * s\n\nx = linspace(-pi, pi, 800)\nplot(x, square_wave(x, 1), title=\"傅里叶级数逼近方波\", xlabel=\"x\", ylabel=\"f(x)\", label=\"1 项\")\nplot(x, square_wave(x, 3), label=\"3 项\")\nplot(x, square_wave(x, 20), label=\"20 项\")\n",
      "execution_count": 1,
      "outputs": [
